 flowchart TD
 U[User] --> UI[Support Portal]
 UI -->|Submit ticket| A1[Create Ticket]
 
 subgraph Submission["Ticket Submission"]
   A1 --> V{Details valid?}
   V -- No --> E1[Show validation error]
   V -- Yes --> S1[Save ticket]
   S1 --> C1[Show ticket confirmation]
   S1 --> Q1[Send to processing queue]
 end
 
 UI -->|Check progress| A2[View Ticket Status]
 
 subgraph Status["Status Tracking"]
   A2 --> F1[Fetch latest ticket status]
   F1 --> ST{Current status}
   ST -- Queued or Processing --> P1[Keep checking]
   ST -- Completed --> D1[Show triage summary and draft reply]
   ST -- Failed --> R1[Show failure and allow resubmission]
 end
 
 subgraph Processing["Background Processing"]
   W0[Processor running] --> W1[Pick queued ticket]
   W1 --> T1[Analyze issue]
   T1 --> K1{Analysis successful?}
   K1 -- No --> X1[Mark ticket as failed]
   K1 -- Yes --> D2[Generate response draft]
   D2 --> K2{Draft successful?}
   K2 -- No --> X1
   K2 -- Yes --> S2[Save result and mark completed]
   S2 --> W1
   X1 --> W1
 end
 
 Q1 --> W1